<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row my-5">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-8 mx-auto">
        <div class="p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm" style="background: var(--wl-surface); border: 1px solid var(--wl-border);">
            <span class="wl-badge wl-badge--verified mb-2">Legal & Compliance</span>
            <h1 class="wl-display wl-h2 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="wl-muted small">Effective: September 2026 &bull; Version 2.0</p>
            <hr class="my-4" style="border-color: var(--wl-border);">

            <h3 class="wl-h3 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p class="wl-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                We collect personal information that you provide when registering an account, creating stay listings, reserving accommodations, leaving reviews, or contacting customer support. This includes your name, email address, contact numbers, and payment transaction references.
            </p>

            <h3 class="wl-h3 mt-4 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p class="wl-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                Your information is used solely to facilitate stay reservations, process bookings, display listings, communicate with hosts and guests, detect fraudulent activity, and comply with legal regulatory obligations.
            </p>

            <h3 class="wl-h3 mt-4 mb-2">3. Data Security & Storage</h3>
            <p class="wl-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                Wanderlust implements enterprise-grade encryption protocols, HTTPS transmission, salted password hashing, and encrypted database sessions. We never sell your personal data to third parties.
            </p>

            <h3 class="wl-h3 mt-4 mb-2">4. Your Rights & Data Portability</h3>
            <p class="wl-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                You have the right to access, rectify, or request deletion of your personal data at any time through your Profile Dashboard or by contacting support@wanderlust.com.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-5">
                <a href="/listings" class="wl-btn wl-btn--primary">Back to Stays</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
